\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af41\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f41\fs24\ul\cf17\insrsid2326415\charrsid3503769 Sorted:--
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs18 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs18\cf17\insrsid2326415 A sorted collection means that the order in the collection is determined according to some
\par rule or rules, known as the sort order. A sort order has nothing to do with when an object was
\par added to the collection, or when wa}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs18 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs18\cf17\insrsid3503769 s the last time it was accessed, or what position it was added.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs18 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs18\cf17\insrsid2326415 
